 "remarks": "Welcome to 7 Hadik Parkway, a spacious and versatile Cape tucked away on a quiet dead-end street in Norwalk's desirable Brookside neighborhood. Offering nearly 2,150 square feet of living space, this 4-bedroom, 3-full-bath home combines character, functionality, and plenty of room to grow. The main level features an inviting open floor plan with beautiful hardwood floors, a fireplace, and abundant natural light. At the heart of the home is an updated kitchen featuring stone countertops, stainless steel appliances, ample cabinetry, and a custom-built stone pizza oven that makes this space truly unique. You can also listen to music on your built-in home audio system while cooking for family and friends any time of the year. Two bedrooms on the main level provide flexibility for guests, a home office, or one-level living, while two additional bedrooms upstairs offer added privacy. The full sized basement can easily be finished with its 7'+ ceilings, with the potential for additional living space, ideal for a recreation room, home office, studio, gym, or other use. Outside, enjoy a large deck overlooking the spacious, fully fenced in backyard, and separate fenced in shed. Perfect for entertaining, relaxing, gardening, or pets. The home's convenient Norwalk location offers easy access to shopping, dining, major commuter routes, and everything Fairfield County has to offer. With generous living space inside and out, 7 Hadik Parkway is ready for its next chapter. Schedule your priva",
